1
00:05:03,157 --> 00:05:09,157
Disorientation. Hallucinations. Hysteria. Sleep is survival.

2
00:10:06,315 --> 00:10:12,315
Awake is a drama, science fiction, thriller film directed by Mark Raso.

3
00:15:09,473 --> 00:15:15,473
After a sudden global event wipes out all electronics and takes away
humankind’s ability to sleep, chaos quickly begins to consume the world.

4
00:20:12,631 --> 00:20:18,631
Only Jill, an ex-soldier with a troubled past, may hold the
key to a cure in the form of her own daughter.

5
00:25:15,789 --> 00:25:21,789
The question is, can Jill safely deliver her daughter and save
the world before she herself loses her mind.

6
00:30:18,947 --> 00:30:24,947
Jill, played by Gina Rodriguez.

7
00:35:22,105 --> 00:35:28,105
Matilda, played by Ariana Greenblatt.

8
00:40:25,263 --> 00:40:31,263
Noah, played by Lucius Hoyos.

9
00:45:28,421 --> 00:45:34,421
Dodge, played by Shamier Anderson.

10
00:50:31,578 --> 00:50:37,578
Dr. Murphy, played by Jennifer Jason Leigh.

11
00:55:34,736 --> 00:55:40,736
Brian, played by Finn Jones.

12
01:00:37,894 --> 01:00:43,894
Awake is a 2021 American apocalyptic science fiction thriller film, directed by
Mark Raso, from a screenplay he wrote alongside Joseph Raso.

13
01:05:41,052 --> 01:05:47,052
It stars Gina Rodriguez, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Barry Pepper, Finn Jones, Shamier Anderson,
Ariana Greenblatt, Frances Fisher, Elias Edraki, Lucius Hoyos and Gil Bellows.

14
01:10:44,210 --> 01:10:50,210
Rodriguez plays Jill (Rodriguez) who discovers her daughter (Greenblatt) may be immune to a disorder causing mass
chronic sleep deprivation and attempts to bring her daughter to a laboratory to help develop a cure.

15
01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
The film was released by Netflix on June 9, 2021, and received generally negative reviews
from film critics who criticized the derivative plot and lack of tension.

16
01:20:50,526 --> 01:20:56,526
However, it reached number one worldwide on the platform when it was released.

17
01:25:53,684 --> 01:25:59,684
The film explores themes of end of the world, apocalypse, sleep deprivation.

18
01:30:56,842 --> 01:31:02,842
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking and intense.
